<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Jan 14.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Jan 14.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali to give Culture Day speech on Tuesday.</p>
<p>- President chairs cabinet meeting on education.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Justice Minister Sadok Chaabane says Tunisia's laws to be amended to meet international accords.</p>
<p>LE RENOUVEAU</p>
<p>- Cabinet ministers visit the countryside to explain the last speech of President Ben Ali on December 28.</p>
</text>
